div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20the%20Kings\">Isle of the Kings</a>, North of the Thais <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple\">temple</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lubo\">Lubos</a> house, west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> (with <a href=\"#/wiki/Sheep\">sheep</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> north of castle and one south towards <a href=\"#/wiki/Noodles%20Academy%20of%20Modern%20Magic\">Ivory Towers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a> (Silverhand Manor), <a href=\"#/wiki/Mintwallin\">Mintwallin</a> central park and on the way to the old <a href=\"#/wiki/Mintwallin\">Mintwallin</a> area, <a href=\"#/wiki/Factory%20Quarter\">Factory Quarter</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tDogs normally follow you around.<br/><br/>A dog does not attack. A dog will retreat at 8  (40%, yellow) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tJust attack them and they will run or die shortly after.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 4,961 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Canines\">Canines</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Annoying%20Dog\">Annoying Dog</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Wolf\">Crystal Wolf</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Doomhowl\">Doomhowl</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eating%20Dog\">Eating Dog</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feroxa\">Feroxa</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feroxa%20%28Gloom%20Wolf%29\">Feroxa (Gloom Wolf)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feroxa%20%28Killable%20Werewolf%29\">Feroxa (Killable Werewolf)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feroxa%20%28Werewolf%29\">Feroxa (Werewolf)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fox\">Fox</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frostfur\">Frostfur</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost%20Wolf\">Ghost Wolf</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gloom%20Wolf\">Gloom Wolf</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellhound\">Hellhound</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hemming\">Hemming</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hot%20Dog\">Hot Dog</a>